      "description" : {
         "content" : [
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "•\t>>> CONSIDER getting rid of TRAITS from Mapping<> template – and JUST use TRAITS on tempalted CONSTRUCTOR. This would be a big change, but perhaps an improvement (aling the lines of SCARY) – so easy to hand data from one container to another.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "\tStrongly consider getting rid of TRAITS from parameterizion of containers – EXCEPT for CTOR!!! That may simplify things A LOT (means we still templatize REP as is). But everything else – I THINK – gets simpler (except for some stuff we chose not to make virtual – we may need todo virtually in the rep)",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "\tCONSIDER CASE OF EQUALS(). REALLY DEPNDS ON BOTH AGRREING. MAYBE COMPARE function really belongs as part of the type?",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            }
         ],
         "type" : "doc",
         "version" : 1
      },
